            "review_text": "Reception A\n1 contribution\n0\nGood food and reasonable price\nJun 2018 • Family\nThis was one of the good restaurant in Chinatown which my family could find serving an authentic food.The lady introduce us to try their special menu the duck herbal soup noodles, so my sister has tried that and she loves the flavor of the soup. We also ordered fried rice and combination stir-fry with crunchy noodles and some soft drink. In overall, the price was reasonable for a family dinner. We would love to recommend to all our friends and new travelers.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 27, 2018",
