            "review_text": "Rachel J\nMelbourne, Australia124 contributions\n0\nGreat little fibd\nMar 2016 • Couples\nWe were at the markets and looking for a place near by to get out of the heat, with some food and a cold beer.\n\nHard to find this place after reading trip advisor but glad we did.\nIt on a the corner ( diagonally opposite) the market. We mistook it just for a food / market shop initially.\n\nStaff lovely, food good / cheap and a clean toilet \n\nGreat little find that we felt comfortable eating in and having a break.\n\nThanks Tiem An Nam Long\nRead more\nWritten March 18, 2016",
