            "review_text": "Peter B\nBunbury, Australia134 contributions\n0\nAuthentic food and very cheap\nApr 2013 • Couples\nEat with the locals in this authentic Vietnamese restaurant with a huge selection of dishes to pick from.\nFriendly staff and customers alike made this a memorable experience. Across the road from the very busy Chinese Markets, you can come over and sit and get your breath back.\nHighly recommended for a true taste of Vietnamese street food\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 8, 2013",
