            "review_text": "mbloechi\n37 contributions\n1\nOkay food after visiting the market\nThe restaurant is just around the corner of the market in Saigon’s china quarter. They offer a good choice of rice and noodle dishes which are reasonable priced. Staff was very friendly and helpful to us. A good place for a quick lunch after visiting the market. They prepare the food freshly in their wok, quality was fine.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 24, 2012",
